flowchart TD
    A["Start Program: Main.main()"] --> B["ChaikinApp.run()"]
    B --> C["Create Window (JFrame)"]
    C --> D["Attach CanvasPanel & MouseHandler"]
    D --> E["Wait for User Input"]
    E -->|Left Mouse Click| F["MouseHandler adds Point to fixedPoints"]
